/target/
# Test captures land in gitignored scratch dirs — a camera frame never enters the
# repository (design §5).
/scratch/
**/*.rs.bk
.DS_Store
.claude/

# The blessed privileged helper and its stamp. A capability-carrying binary must never be
# committed: git does not preserve xattrs, so a committed copy would be an un-capped
# binary that looks blessed, and anything that DID preserve them would be shipping root.
/.wch-bin/

# The R1-web rung's own tooling (design §3.1). `package.json` and `package-lock.json` are
# committed — they are the pin, and a pin that is not in the repository is not a pin — but
# the installed tree is not: it is tens of megabytes of somebody else's code, `just
# rung-web-install` puts it back from the lockfile, and its absence is a named, counted skip
# rather than a failure. Node is never a build dependency, so a clone without this still
# builds every crate.
/crates/daemon/tests/browser/node_modules/
